Feedback from real payslip (PHV 237.18, odpracováno 149.83 h): Adecco excludes
náhrada mzdy při DPN from hrubá mzda entirely — no SP/ZP, no income tax, added
straight to the payout. Previously we counted it inside gross and taxed it,
inflating gross by ~2.5k and skewing net.

- payroll: nemoc day -> E=0, compensation in new field 'nem' (net-only)
- summary: 'Odpracováno' hours now exclude sick/vacation hours (149.83 not 169.17)
- summary net = calcNetto(gross) + nem; calendar/breakdown show sick-day pay
- payslip print: gross excludes náhrada, 'K výplatě' includes it (Adecco-style)
- api: netEstimate updated, day objects expose 'nem'
- tests: colleague payslip 08/2026 reproduced (gross 36 831, net 32 069 within
  the 0.8h night-window rounding, ~20 Kč); 34 tests pass
